{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"39ac090d45fda99302762c0f4b2e55c39cc6885a55d4539c01af23f57d3a9e34","ja":"キラキラしちゃおう！","zh":"闪闪发光吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"cdd15e841715561bcc136328d98289a0837b139fef8beaf57715bae1a0443d0a","ja":"お仕事もおわったし、そろそろ\n劇場に帰ろうかねぇ……あれ？　美希さんは？","zh":"工作也结束了，差不多该\n回剧场去啦……咦？美希呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"25e9561ba7244475b850589e65d1e8a9e15bac6191daf6606dc561191c1dae84","ja":"美希さん……さっきまでここにいた、けど……。\nあっ、いた……。あそこ……雑誌、見てる……。","zh":"美希……刚才明明还在这里的……\n啊，找到了……在看杂志……在那边……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"bfe642afb45ba0139fbfa25ef0c2b1bbf8bb7dbb5e44961f94c19aad13125762","ja":"美希さん、いったい何を見ているんだい？","zh":"美希，你到底在看什么呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f99662715d97d0ffbef56c1f1f058649c8c31e1d92449dfee24ad573e038369a","ja":"ギャル雑誌の特集だよ♪\n見て見て！　これ、すっごくかわいいの☆","zh":"是辣妹杂志的特辑哦♪\n快看快看！这个超级可爱☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"20f6a7491a187b2b9a60e40957758becd72f05331d2ccea5eae83eeae39ad63f","ja":"『持ち物デコレーション特集……\nかわいく作って、個性をアゲちゃえ』……？","zh":"『随身物品装饰特辑……\n做成可爱的样子，让个性更出彩』……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8925cc73ab3ed595c445c2a1235ad65a7443eb9632ad3e63079e258a6bda0ea9","ja":"わぁ～、どれもキラキラしてて、\nなまらかわいいねぇ。","zh":"哇～，每一个都闪闪发亮的，\n真的好可爱呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3298743948e0eb726faae7caddf80648d6782231ff35ce5b2a3de692858170a0","ja":"でしょ！　こういうのって自分で作れるみたいだし、\nミキもちょっとやってみようかなって♪","zh":"对吧！这种东西好像也能自己做，\n美希也想稍微试着做一下呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"78126f0b15aa6c8ad0c1674bd234bf383cd3baaf22a8906332e60f7a02d63382","ja":"いろんなデザインがあって……キレイ、だね。\nあ、あの……杏奈も、一緒にやりたい……な。","zh":"有各种各样的设计……真好看、呢。\n那、那个……杏奈也想……一起做。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"62efac7b32b8bad97a1f6c53c9b610875dc4a6d587611e07a2faaf2f4ddafadb","ja":"うん、一緒にやるの☆　ひなたはどうする？","zh":"嗯，要一起做哦☆　日向要怎么办？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"21f72b6bbb2d5bab372a31e188afd20cc693823660d752919053823ee572e1ab","ja":"こんなにかわいいのが作れるなら、\nあたしもちょっこし、やってみようかなぁ。","zh":"要是能做出这么可爱的东西，\n我也稍微尝试一下看看吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c85259df76a95033cc84c308f64c93d421d838feef31f74584e0b6b4eaaa0319","ja":"決まりなの！　それじゃあ明日、\nデコりたいものを持って劇場に集合ね♪","zh":"就这么定啦！那明天带上\n想做装饰的东西在剧场集合哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"d91c3b921a4eea40572394c4df050d805b40a2d7f79db89c7659f74faa29abd8","ja":"あ……でも……何をデコれば、\nいいの……かな？","zh":"啊……不过……要装饰些什么，\n才好……呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d8ae6fc7efb0e608e0e314ce78d5c157196c17a48dfa31ef881e3ad3f7f03a73","ja":"あたしも迷うねぇ……おしゃれな物とか、\nあんまし持ってないし……。","zh":"我也很犹豫呢……\n而且我也没怎么有时尚的东西……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"ce091f8aefd12ded01f53784745d0e5dedadb2655cb96cd92c1b940d49e2f6e6","ja":"ん～、別になんでもいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"嗯～，其实随便怎样都行吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1329.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a84addaf87413fdbea17026ef47f24ae8fff1630a41574fa9965e601d083d57b","ja":"ミキ的には　いつも使ってる物を、\nかわいくデコればいいって思うな。あはっ☆","zh":"美希觉得把平时用的东西\n装饰得可爱一点就好啦。啊哈☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
